synopsis:
  Remove boxing datatypes from ``base``
description:
  The boxing datatypes ``IntBox``, ``WordBox``, ``FloatBox``, ``DoubleBox``
  and ``DictBox`` have been removed from ``base``.
  These were exported by mistake, as they were meant only for internal use.
  They have been superseded by the new ``Box`` type (exported by ``ghc-experimental``).
  See `CLC proposal 421 <https://github.com/haskell/core-libraries-committee/issues/421>`_.
